#. ja: 麻雀金言集:ゼロ
#. de: Sammlung[p] „Zeros Mahjong-Weisheiten“
#. fr: exemplaire de l'Art du mahjong<nbsp>: Zero
#. column 2: copies of <i>Maxims of Mahjong - Zero</i>
#. column 8: A record of aphorisms shared while witness to triumphant victories and crushing defeats at the game table. Use to unlock voiced lines from Zero during Doman mahjong.
#. column 9: Maxims of Mahjong - Zero
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:51208:0:0"
msgid "copy of <i>Maxims of Mahjong - Zero</i>"
msgstr "экземпляр <i>«Мудрые изречения о маджонге: Зеро»</i>"

#. de: Sammlungen[p] „Zeros Mahjong-Weisheiten“
#. fr: exemplaires de l'Art du mahjong<nbsp>: Zero
#. column 0: copy of <i>Maxims of Mahjong - Zero</i>
#. column 8: A record of aphorisms shared while witness to triumphant victories and crushing defeats at the game table. Use to unlock voiced lines from Zero during Doman mahjong.
#. column 9: Maxims of Mahjong - Zero
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:51208:0:2"
msgid "copies of <i>Maxims of Mahjong - Zero</i>"
msgstr "экземпляры <i>«Мудрые изречения о маджонге: Зеро»</i>"

#. ja: ドマ式麻雀に関するゼロの金言をまとめた書物<br>[使用するとドマ式麻雀における特定キャラクターの応援演出を修得する]
#. de: Die gesammelten Weisheiten eines (mehr oder weniger) erfahrenen Mahjong-Spielers.<br>Kann benutzt werden, um Tipps eines bestimmten Charakters für das Mahjong-Spiel freizuschalten.
#. fr: Un manuscrit regroupant les conseils avisés de Zero.<br>[Permet d'obtenir un nouveau compagnon sélectionnable pour le mahjong domien]
#. column 0: copy of <i>Maxims of Mahjong - Zero</i>
#. column 2: copies of <i>Maxims of Mahjong - Zero</i>
#. column 9: Maxims of Mahjong - Zero
msgctxt "Item:51208:0:8"
msgid "A record of aphorisms shared while witness to triumphant victories and crushing defeats at the game table. Use to unlock voiced lines from Zero during Doman mahjong."
msgstr "Сборник мудрых изречений, которыми делятся за игровым столом после триумфальных побед и сокрушительных поражений. Используйте, чтобы открыть озвученные реплики Зеро во время доманского маджонга."

