msgid "Phase 19 cosmic tool.<br>Has a chance to reduce the GP cost of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Powerful Hookset</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Precision Hookset</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 50%.<br>Completing a stellar mission from start to finish with this tool equipped grants a bonus to earned rewards.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Auxesia Credit Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +20%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Lunar/Phaenna/Oizys Credit Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +35%"
