#. ja: 詳細地図:三日月島北部
#. de: Karte[p] der Reitwege im nördlichen Kreszentia
#. fr: carte détaillée de l'île de Lunule septentrionale
#. column 2: North Horn riding maps
#. column 8: This highly detailed map of the Occult Crescent's North Horn, including everything from land elevation to the location of exposed rocks and roots, was drafted in hopes of making sense of isle's uniquely frustrating geography.
#. column 9: North Horn Riding Map
